jobs.description:
Electronics Repair Engineer 
 Amsterdam, Noord-Holland 
This permanent Electronics Repair Engineer vacancy is at a fixed office location in Amsterdam and is an inbound position. You'll be working within a team of advanced Electronics Repair professionals and Senior Software Engineers and Architects. 
The employer is a High-tech company in Amsterdam. A dynamic High-tech organization that attaches great value to professionals with a clear structure of work and motivation to take on varied projects at their office in Amsterdam. 
This respected company focuses on carrying out projects and developments of new electronics products for large clients. The assignments often have an affinity with innovative power electronics, control technology and telecommunications. Their clients/customers are successful Tech companies that outsource the work to them entirely. This successful organization takes care of all technical work for their technical customers from the first concept to production. Of course it happens that a technical customer also wants to contribute, which the employer embraces, in order to achieve the best possible result for the client. In their view, supplying custom electronics goes beyond development and production. Organization, logistics, speed, efficiency, quality, reliability and continuity are keywords for success and require intensive cooperation between the employer and its clients. Ultimately, it is about respecting and strengthening each other's interests. 
The office of this employer is easily accessible (free parking) by car and public transport. 
 A brief overview of the Electronics Repair Engineer tasks: 
-Error and malfunction analysis on electronics products; 
-Record analysis data in the English language in administration by using SAP; 
-Repairing mainly specific electronics equipment such as battery chargers and inverters at component levels; 
-Refurbishing and updating used electronics products; 
-Testing and ...
